# AI Employee Platform — Super Admin Dashboard Environment Example
# In development, leave empty to use Vite dev server proxy (forwarding /api to http://127.0.0.1:8001)
# In production with Nginx reverse proxy on the same domain, leave empty to use relative /api/v1 paths.
# If hosting the frontend on a separate domain or CDN, set the full backend base URL (e.g. https://api.yourdomain.com):
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
